      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p>\"<i>Meow? Seems like <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a> is more like an older sis-meow?</i>\"<br />— Pushcat, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></p></blockquote>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Pushcat <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Characters\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/3/36/Characters.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150527022122\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Characters.png\" data-image-key=\"Characters.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/1/1a/PushcatDialogue.png/revision/latest?cb=20150527014149\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"PushcatDialogue\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/1/1a/PushcatDialogue.png/revision/latest?cb=20150527014149\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/1/1a/PushcatDialogue.png/revision/latest?cb=20150527014149 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/1/1a/PushcatDialogue.png/revision/latest?cb=20150527014149 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"PushcatDialogue\" width=\"102\" height=\"73\" data-image-key=\"PushcatDialogue.png\" data-image-name=\"PushcatDialogue.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Name</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pushcat</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"age\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Age</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occup\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Cat</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"firstintroduced\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Introduced In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lastseen\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ongoing</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\nPushcat is a supporting character/item appearing in <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\"><i>Potion Maker</i></a>. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">Personality</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPushcat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Pushcat only has one line in the entire game, aside from the tutorial. However, from those lines it can be determined that he acts or is a young person.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Function\">Function</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPushcat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Pushcat automatically adds <a href=\"/wiki/Materials\" title=\"Materials\">materials</a> into cauldron for 1 minute by default (this time limit may affected by <a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">events</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Fairy\" title=\"Fairy\">fairy</a>) and will stop if the cauldron is empty (time is not counted when empty). One Nyan Ticket <span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-top\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span title=\"nyan-ticket\"><img alt=\"Nyan-Ticket\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/f/f7/Nyan-Ticket.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/27?cb=20150816175817\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Nyan-Ticket.png\" data-image-key=\"Nyan-Ticket.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> is required to summon pushcat. Speed relatively slower than <a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\">Blackcat</a>. With each <a href=\"/wiki/Upgrades\" title=\"Upgrades\">upgrade</a> of Pushcat's level, the speed will be increased.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Blackcat\">Blackcat</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPushcat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is some probability to summon <a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\">Blackcat</a> when summoning Pushcat. For details see <a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\">Blackcat</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#CC0033\" colspan=\"2\">Items\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#FFC; text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Material\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Material\">Material</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Potion\" title=\"Potion\">Potion</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup\" title=\"Powerup\">Powerup</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Costume\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Costume\">Costume</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Fairy\" title=\"Fairy\">Fairy</a> • <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Pushcat</strong> • <a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\">Blackcat</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261012120743\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 96/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 522/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 90/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.828      1 -total\n 73.90%   32.389      1 Template:Characters\n 19.58%    8.581      1 Template:Quote\n  3.34%    1.464      3 Template:PM\n  3.08%    1.351      1 Template:NT\n  2.74%    1.199      1 Template:Navbox-items\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_potionmaker783:pcache:idhash:2168-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261012120743 and revision id 5624. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
